</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel">
<h2>Annual Financial Reports</h2>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel-content">
<p>The City contracts with an independent certified public accountant firm to conduct an annual audit of the City&rsquo;s financial records and internal control systems.&nbsp; As a result of the annual&nbsp;audits, the City Treasurer publishes an Annual Financial and Compliance Report.&nbsp; Copies of these reports for Fiscal Years 2018-2021 can be found below.&nbsp; For archived reports please click <a href="https://www.cheyennecity.org/Your-Government/Departments/City-Treasurer/City-Treasurer-Resources-Documents-Forms-Archives" target="_self">here</a>.</p>
<ul>
<li><a title="FY2025 Annual Financial Compliance Report.pdf" href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/annual-financial-reports/fy2025-annual-financial-compliance-report.pdf" target="_self" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2025-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;1MB)</span></a></li>
<li><a title="FY2024 Annual Financial Compliance Report.pdf" href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/annual-financial-reports/fy2024-annual-financial-compliance-report.pdf" target="_self" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2024-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;896KB)</span></a></li>
<li><a title="FY2023 Annual Financial Compliance Report.pdf" href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/annual-financial-reports/fy2023-annual-financial-compliance-report.pdf" target="_self" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2023-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;920KB)</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/annual-financial-reports/fy-22-annual-financial-report.pdf" target="_self" title="FY-22-Annual-Financial-Report.pdf" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2022-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;941KB)</span></a></li>
<li><a title="FY2021 Annual Financial Compliance Report" href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/annual-financial-reports/fy2021-annual-financial-compliance-report.pdf" target="_self" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2021-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;921KB)</span></a></li>
<li><a title="FY2020-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf" href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/annual-financial-reports/fy2020-annual-financial-report.pdf" target="_self" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2020-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;1MB)</span></a></li>
<li><a title="FY2019-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf" href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/annual-financial-reports/fy2019-annual-financial-compliance-report.pdf" target="_self" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2019-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;731KB)</span></a></li>
<li><a title="FY2018-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf" href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/annual-financial-reports/fy2018-annual-financial-compliance-report.pdf" target="_self" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2018-Annual-Financial-Compliance-Report.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;1003KB)</span></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel">
<h2>Capital Improvement Plans</h2>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel-content">
<p>A Capital Improvement Plan (CIP) is an important instrument used by the City for planning and managing capital assets. &nbsp;Below are copies of the current CIP documents. For archived documents please click <a href="https://www.cheyennecity.org/Your-Government/Departments/City-Treasurer/City-Treasurer-Resources-Documents-Forms-Archives" target="_top">here</a>.</p>
<ul>
<li><a title="City of Cheyenne Capital Improvement Plan for Fiscal Years 2025-2029" href="/files/sharedassets/public/v/1/departments/city-treasurer/capital-improvement-plans/fy2025-2029-cip.pdf" target="_self" class="document ext-pdf"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>FY2025-2029-CIP.pdf<span class="file-info">(PDF,&nbsp;10MB)</span></a></li>
